2. capacity visibility — a quota-shaped failure is stamped and rendered
  ok    quota-shaped dispatch fails loudly
  ok    state.json records lastCapacityEvent with the failure detail: {"at":"time unknown","detail":"429 rate limit exceeded — usage limit reached for this account"}
  ok    adapter status surfaces the capacity event
  ok    floor --once renders the AMBER PARKED/QUOTA line with the re-probe command
  ok    floor STATUS cell shows per-account capacity state
  ok    a dispatch that lands clears the capacity event

3. canary — can these checks detect broken isolation and a lost stamp?
  ok    canary: an adapter that merges both seats into one log is caught
  ok    canary: serialized turns fail the same barrier assertion
